      "level": "info",
      "id": "stylesheets-outside-the-build",
      "lines": [
        "css holds 7 stylesheets, 18,436 B, and no page of this build loads any of them: no entry in js is named after one, and none is reached from an entry that is.",
        "  Loaded from PHP: editor.css (templates/editor.php), format.css (lib/Listeners/FileSharingListener.php), main.css (lib/Listeners/FileSharingListener.php), settings.css (templates/settings.php), share.css (lib/Listeners/FilesListener.php), template.css (lib/Listeners/FilesListener.php), viewer.css (lib/Listeners/ViewerListener.php).",
        "  Each is loaded from PHP or built into the bundle, so none is left without a loader. Where the build writes its stylesheets somewhere else, --css=DIR names that directory."
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "info",
      "id": "non-esm",
      "lines": [
        "3 files look like a webpack or CommonJS bundle. Their internal structure is not derivable from the artefact, so each counts as one file."
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "ok",
      "id": "no-package-root-imported",
      "lines": [
        "No package is imported as a whole: every package contributes only the modules that are used (43 packages, 130 modules).",
        "On this measure the form of importing is exhausted. A root import whose barrel the bundler removes completely leaves no trace, so this is evidence, not proof."
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "ok",
      "id": "no-duplicated-modules",
      "lines": [
